        "kind": "migration-required",
        "exposedClass": "action-required",
        "statement": "Unless Flux Operator is used to deploy the Flux controllers, `flux migrate` must be run on the cluster before upgrading to Flux 2.7.0; if the operator does nothing, the migration off the removed v1beta1/v2beta1 APIs is not performed.",
        "remediation": "Run `flux migrate` on clusters before upgrading to Flux 2.7.0 (not required when Flux Operator is used to deploy the Flux controllers); see the Flux v2.7 upgrade guide linked in the release notes.",
