      },
      "statement": "The Flux APIs v1beta1 and v2beta1 (deprecated in 2023) have reached end-of-life and have been removed from the CRDs in Flux 2.7.0, and clusters not using Flux Operator to deploy the Flux controllers must run `flux migrate` before upgrading."
